      },
      "description": "## Update the listProductsTool\n\nNow here comes the fun part! We will need to replace the `fetch` call in all five tool `execute` functions with our newly created `apiFetch` helper function. This will ensure that the access token is added to the `Authorization` header for all tool calls.\n\n1. Select the **Insert code** link below to replace `fetch` with `apiFetch`\n\n```ts\napiFetch\n```"
    },
